OAO6SJc8AAAABAngYHw","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T14:48:51Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T17:48:54Z","body":"Both cases are not intended and are oversights.\nCase A was intended for when drop mode flags are ONLY set to `On Item`.\nCase B's problem was correctly identified by the issue author, and most immediately affects the Input Map editor.\n\n> The larger issue, however, is that after these changes, it is now impossible to get the correct drop section in situations where dropping an item there would not be allowed. There are a number of different situations where you would want to be able to access the theoretical drop section regardless of whether it would be valid, such as changing the text of a warning tooltip or writing custom logic to determine if the specific item being dropped is valid in that section.\n\nI will fix the above cases, and investigate how to minimally keep my changes to editor Trees without affecting the GUI node as a whole.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repo